         debug variant, whose manifest uses its own icon (ic_launcher_build;
         see appIcon in build.gradle.kts), so to lint these look unused. -->
    <issue id="UnusedResources">
        <ignore path="src/main/res/mipmap-anydpi/ic_launcher.xml" />
        <ignore path="src/main/res/mipmap-*/ic_launcher_monochrome.png" />
    </issue>
</lint>
